OL,3,AVerdicts being delivered in Huntingdon
OL,4,Atrain attacker attempted murder trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FJurors are returning their verdicts in
OL,7,Fthe trial of a knifeman accused of
OL,8,Fattempting to murder 10 people on a
OL,9,FLondon-bound train
OL,11,FAnthony Williams, 33, stabbed 10 people
OL,12,Fbetween Peterborough and Huntingdon,
OL,13,FCambridgeshire, on an LNER service on 1
OL,14,FNovember 2025
OL,16,FHe denies the charges of attempted
OL,17,Fmurder on the train but has admitted 10
OL,18,Fcounts of wounding with intent to cause
OL,19,Freally serious bodily harm
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
