OL,3,AVerdicts being delivered in Huntingdon
OL,4,Atrain attacker attempted murder trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring the trial, one victim said he
OL,7,Fsuspected the attack was a "joke" but
OL,8,Flater asked hospital staff "am I going
OL,9,Fto die today?"
OL,11,FPassengers and an LNER staff member
OL,12,Fsaid they used various objects -
OL,13,Fincluding a frying pan, walking frame
OL,14,Fand toaster - to defend themselves
OL,16,FWilliams has separately pleaded not
OL,17,Fguilty to the attempted murders of
OL,18,Fthree people in Peterborough and a boy
OL,19,Fin London prior to the LNER attack
